WEBVTT

00:02:55.990 --> 00:03:00.040
Nuk kam pse te kenaq burrat me,

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:02.888
vetem kafshet.

00:03:02.888 --> 00:03:06.430
Vazhdoj ti them egos sime shume
te madhe te zbrapset

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.612
dhe te me lejoje te shijoj 
ato qe akoma kam.

00:03:08.612 --> 00:03:10.671
Trupi im mund te jete duke u shperbere,

00:03:10.671 --> 00:03:14.125
por truri im akoma jo.

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:16.172
E dashuroj trurin tim.

00:03:16.172 --> 00:03:19.130
Ndjehem me e lehte.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:24.407
Nuk mbaj me vete inate, ambicie, kotesi,

00:03:24.407 --> 00:03:26.262
asnje nga mekatet vrastare per te cilat as

00:03:26.262 --> 00:03:28.456
nuk ia vlen te shqetesohesh.

00:03:28.456 --> 00:03:30.200
Eshte e mrekullueshme te lesh te shkoje.